This project includes adaptations of Herdr default mods from Herdr v0.1.9:
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app/tree/3e32d75e7aa2327d7b1f89caf3d5dafd1f44f1b2

  mods/compact-spaces/main.js   <- defaults/mods/spaces/main.js
  mods/space-agents/main.js     <- defaults/mods/agents/main.js
  mods/session-tabs/main.js     <- defaults/mods/tabs/main.js
  mods/workspace-header/main.js <- defaults/mods/workspace-chrome/main.js

